{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24058","headline":"张常侍池凉夜闲讌赠诸公 · 白居易","name":"张常侍池凉夜闲讌赠诸公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"竹桥新月上，水岸凉风至。\n对月五六人，管弦三两事。\n留连池上酌，款曲城外意。\n或啸或讴吟，谁知此闲味。\n回看市朝客，矻矻趋名利。\n朝忙少游宴，夕困多眠睡。\n清凉属吾徒，相逢勿辞醉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24058.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24058","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}